Read complete relevant issued modules for connection, network data, operating conditions, measurement, losses and service quality, and the applicable network procedures for the chosen system. Retain jurisdiction, effective dates and version. Compare a design's calculated performance with the particular requirement and its defined measurement/test method.

Official indexes and their roles were checked on 29 October 2026; ONS navigation required scripts for fuller access. Proposed rule changes, public consultations and issued effective procedures are different states. A course example or an older module cannot establish current compliance, and no fixed current threshold is asserted here. Standards, occupational rules, regulator requirements and interconnection agreements also serve different purposes. No modules, legal compilations, system data or internal procedures are copied into the repository.

